<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys down 3 percent on retail selling.</title>
<headline>Hayleys down 3 percent on retail selling.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayleys Ltd fell five rupees or three percent to 175, on 500 shares traded, brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;A retail investor is selling to raise some cash, probably for the coming holiday season,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Hayleys is one of three blue-chip conglomerates listed in Colombo and its price performance has a big impact on the overall market.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
